            "title": "Anthropic resignation sparks D.C. firestorm",
            "summary": "Researcher Jacob Coxon's public resignation \u2014 in which he warned that OpenAI and Anthropic are \"gambling with our lives\" and that AI could cause human extinction within a decade \u2014 triggered the broadest congressional response to an AI safety warning yet. More than 20 lawmakers, spanning both parties, called for stronger regulation this week, including Senators Ted Cruz, Josh Hawley, and Amy Klobuchar, who are collaborating on a bill to address \"catastrophic risks.\" The Pentagon, by contrast, dismissed the warnings as \"fear coagulated into one well-written tweet.\"",
