            "summary": "As of June 1, GitHub migrated all Copilot plans from fixed per-seat pricing to a usage-based AI Credits model, with code review now also consuming Actions minutes. Teams running agentic or long multi-step coding sessions face unpredictable cost spikes, prompting GitHub to introduce user-level budget controls and an upgrade path to Copilot Max. The change is already drawing comparisons to early AWS surprise invoices.",
