            "summary": "President Trump signed the executive order 'Promoting Advanced Artificial Intelligence Innovation and Security' on June 2, favoring voluntary industry collaboration over mandatory regulation and explicitly ruling out any pre-approval or licensing system for AI models. A 30-day voluntary government review window for powerful new models replaces the earlier draft's 90-day version. The order also prioritizes AI-enabled cyber defense for federal and critical infrastructure systems.",
