            "summary": "Florida's Republican Attorney General filed a civil lawsuit against OpenAI and CEO Sam Altman, alleging the company knowingly concealed ChatGPT's risks and marketed it aggressively to residents, including children. The complaint cites deceptive trade practices, dependency-inducing design, data collection from minors, and dangerous outputs including content that could encourage self-harm. The suit is notable as a state-led consumer protection action against an AI company, and it signals a fracture in GOP unity on AI \u2014 Florida's AG moved opposite to the Trump administration's light-touch posture.",
