            "title": "All 50 states are writing AI law \u2014 and the chaos is just beginning",
            "summary": "As of May 2026, over 2,182 AI-related bills have been introduced across all 50 US states, with conflicting definitions, audit timelines, and enforcement mechanisms creating a compliance nightmare for multi-state operators. A proposed federal 10-year moratorium on state AI enforcement was defeated 99-to-1 in the Senate, and Congress has not passed preemption legislation despite White House pressure. The Cloud Security Alliance now describes the situation as a structural governance fragmentation that multi-state organizations can no longer plan around.",
